1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,525
The water cycle moves water
around our planet again and again.

2
00:00:04,492 --> 00:00:08,092
The sun warms the ocean and water
rises into the air as vapour.

3
00:00:09,076 --> 00:00:11,876
High in the sky the vapour
cools and forms clouds.

4
00:00:12,868 --> 00:00:16,331
When the clouds grow heavy, rain
falls on mountains and fields.

5
00:00:17,308 --> 00:00:20,895
Streams collect the rain and carry
it down rivers back to the sea.

6
00:00:21,892 --> 00:00:25,230
Some water soaks into the soil
and feeds trees and crops.

7
00:00:26,212 --> 00:00:28,062
Then the cycle begins once more.
